+## Integration with RALPH
+
+After prd.json is created:
+
+1. **Create feature branch:**
+   ```bash
+   git checkout -b ralph/[feature-slug]
+   ```
+
+2. **Start RALPH:**
+   ```bash
+   ./scripts/ralph/ralph.sh 20
+   ```
+
+3. **Monitor progress:**
+   ```bash
+   tail -f progress.txt
+   cat prd.json | jq '.userStories[] | {id, title, passes}'
+   ```
+
+4. **When complete:**
+   ```bash
+   git log --oneline
+   # Review changes, create PR
+   ```
